    title: "Watch: How a community living under demolition orders from Israel view UK sanctions",
    summary: "Middle East Correspondent Lucy Williamson visits the Palestinian community of Khan al Ahmar, and the neighbouring Israeli settlement of Maale Admumim.",
    preview: "How a community living under demolition orders from Israel view UK sanctions UK sanctions on illegal Israeli settlements in the occupied West Bank have triggered a series of Israeli counter-measures against UK nationals and organisations. The sanctions came after Israel opened up tenders for the construction of settlement homes in the strategically important so-called E1 area east of Jerusalem, plans that have drawn widespread international condemnation. The development would in effect divide the West Bank in two, and isolate East Jerusalem.",
    body: "How a community living under demolition orders from Israel view UK sanctions\n\nUK sanctions on illegal Israeli settlements in the occupied West Bank have triggered a series of Israeli counter-measures against UK nationals and organisations.\n\nThe sanctions came after Israel opened up tenders for the construction of settlement homes in the strategically important so-called E1 area east of Jerusalem, plans that have drawn widespread international condemnation.\n\nThe development would in effect divide the West Bank in two, and isolate East Jerusalem.\n\nThe BBC's Middle East Correspondent Lucy Williamson has been to the Palestinian community of Khan al Ahmar in the E1 area, and also to the neighbouring Israeli settlement of Maale Admumim.\n\nRelated topics\n\n- IsraelUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- West BankUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Israel & the PalestiniansUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Palestinian territoriesUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.\n\n- Middle EastUpdates from your News topics will appear in My News and in a collection on the News homepage.",
